  "notes": "{適正|てきせい} indicates something is at the right or proper level.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {適正|てきせい}{価格|かかく} (fair price)\n- {適正|てきせい}な{量|りょう} (appropriate amount)\n- {適正|てきせい}{人数|にんずう} (appropriate number of people)\n- {適正|てきせい}{使用|しよう} (proper use)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {適切|てきせつ}: appropriate, suitable (more about choosing correctly)\n- {適当|てきとう}: suitable, appropriate (can also mean 'random/careless')",
